        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Nobody's Hero\", \"Counterparts\"\n- People: Neil Peart\n- Organizations: Rush, Modern Drummer Hall of Fame\n- Topics: music awards, song releases\n\nFacts:\n- In 1983, Neil Peart was inducted into the Modern Drummer Hall of Fame.\n- In 1983, Neil Peart became the youngest person ever inducted into the Modern Drummer Hall of Fame.\n- Neil Peart has received numerous awards for his musical performances.\n- \"Nobody's Hero\" is a song by the Canadian progressive rock band Rush.\n- \"Nobody's Hero\" was released as the third single from Rush's 1993 album \"Counterparts\".",
